<title>BRAZIL: Brazil orange juice industry reports weekly output.</title>
<headline>Brazil orange juice industry reports weekly output.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's Association of Citrus Exporters reported the following output and exports of frozen concentrated orange juice in tonnes 66 Brix for Dec 16 to Jan 5 and the total so far in 1996/97.</p>
<p>		Dec 16-Jan 5 Dec 18-Jan 7   TOTAL	  TOTAL</p>
<p>		 1996/97     1995/96	1996/97	1995/96</p>
<p> Stocks/open    519,721.6   429,850.6</p>
<p> Production	80,657.8    88,895.0     988,406.5</p>
<p>810,573.1</p>
<p> Shipment	 105,228.2    57,542.4     655,023.2</p>
<p>436,335.8</p>
<p> Home Market	  813.9	 982.6	 8,493.8</p>
<p>10,524.4</p>
<p> Stocks/close   494,337.3   460,220.6</p>
<p>--Joelle Diderich, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151</p>
</text>
